 style=""><div class="gf_column gf_col-lg-9 gf_col-md-9 gf_col-sm-9 gf_col-xs-12" id="c-1543568570869" data-id="1543568570869" style=""><div data-label="Text Block" id="e-1643396511446" class="element-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-textblock" data-ver="1" data-id="1643396511446"><div class="elm text-edit gf-elm-left gf-elm-left-md gf-elm-left-sm gf-elm-left-xs gf-elm-left-lg gf_gs-text-paragraph-1" data-gemlang="en" data-exc=""><p>L2 Gym introductory tutorial</p></div></div><div data-label="Text Block" data-key="text-block" id="e-1643396511533" class="element-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-textblock" data-ver="1" data-id="1643396511533"><div class="elm text-edit gf-elm-left gf_gs-text-paragraph-1" data-gemlang="en"><p>This video explains each step of the Level 2 Gym Instructing qualification.</p><p><br></p></div></div><div data-label="Vimeo" data-key="vimeo" data-atomgroup="module" id="m-1643396540173" class="module-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-vimeo" data-ver="1" data-id="1643396540173" style=""><div class="module " data-url="https://vimeo.com/875206371/03b9de5b39?share=copy" data-autopause="1" data-autoplay="0" data-badge="" data-videoloop="0" data-byline="0" data-showtitle="0" data-showportrait="0" data-videomute="0"><div class="vimeo_video videoFullScreen"></div></div><div class="gf_vimeo-overlay"></div></div></div><div class="gf_column gf_col-lg-3 gf_col-md-3 gf_col-sm-3 gf_col-xs-12" id="c-1543568601424" data-id="1543568601424"></div></div><!--gfsplit--><div data-label="Row" id="r-1646576797928" class="gf_row" data-icon="gpicon-row" data-id="1646576797928" data-extraclass="" style=""><div class="gf_column gf_col-lg-9 gf_col-md-9 gf_col-sm-9 gf_col-xs-12" id="c-1543568570869" data-id="1543568570869" style=""><div data-label="Text Block" id="e-1646576797949" class="element-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-textblock" data-ver="1" data-id="1646576797949"><div class="elm text-edit gf-elm-left gf-elm-left-md gf-elm-left-sm gf-elm-left-xs gf-elm-left-lg gf_gs-text-paragraph-1" data-gemlang="en" data-exc=""><p>L2 Gym coursework guidance tutorial</p></div></div><div data-label="Text Block" data-key="text-block" id="e-1646576797823" class="element-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-textblock" data-ver="1" data-id="1646576797823"><div class="elm text-edit gf-elm-left gf_gs-text-paragraph-1" data-gemlang="en"><p>This explores the coursework element of the level 2 Gym Instructor qualification. (Please note where YouTube videos are referenced, please see the tutorial videos below as all tutorial videos are now on this one page)</p><p><br></p></div></div><div data-label="Vimeo" data-key="vimeo" data-atomgroup="module" id="m-1646576797946" class="module-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-vimeo" data-ver="1" data-id="1646576797946" style=""><div class="module " data-url="https://vimeo.com/925444443/fcffd7462c?share=copy" data-autopause="1" data-autoplay="0" data-badge="" data-videoloop="0" data-byline="0" data-showtitle="0" data-showportrait="0" data-videomute="0"><div class="vimeo_video videoFullScreen"></div></div><div class="gf_vimeo-overlay"></div></div></div><div class="gf_column gf_col-lg-3 gf_col-md-3 gf_col-sm-3 gf_col-xs-12" id="c-1543568601424" data-id="1543568601424"></div></div><!--gfsplit--><div data-label="Row" id="r-1643396690131" class="gf_row" data-icon="gpicon-row" data-id="1643396690131" data-extraclass=""><div class="gf_column gf_col-lg-9 gf_col-md-9 gf_col-sm-9 gf_col-xs-12" id="c-1543568570869" data-id="1543568570869" style=""><div data-label="Text Block" id="e-1643396690002" class="element-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-textblock" data-ver="1" data-id="1643396690002"><div class="elm text-edit gf-elm-left gf-elm-left-md gf-elm-left-sm gf-elm-left-xs gf-elm-left-lg gf_gs-text-paragraph-1" data-gemlang="en" data-exc=""><p>L2 Gym TNA, SWOT & PPDP</p></div></div><div data-label="Text Block" data-key="text-block" id="e-1643396690031" class="element-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-textblock" data-ver="1" data-id="1643396690031"><div class="elm text-edit gf-elm-left gf_gs-text-paragraph-1" data-gemlang="en"><p>Understand how to evaluate your self to pursue with your fitness career be it starting out as a gym instructor or in a senior fitness position like a personal-trainer.</p><p><br></p></div></div><div data-label="Vimeo" data-key="vimeo" data-atomgroup="module" id="m-1643396701779" class="module-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-vimeo" data-ver="1" data-id="1643396701779" style=""><div class="module " data-url="https://vimeo.com/686265623/a26a705530" data-autopause="1" data-autoplay="0" data-badge="" data-videoloop="0" data-byline="0" data-showtitle="0" data-showportrait="0" data-videomute="0"><div class="vimeo_video videoFullScreen"></div></div><div class="gf_vimeo-overlay"></div></div></div><div class="gf_column gf_col-lg-3 gf_col-md-3 gf_col-sm-3 gf_col-xs-12" id="c-1543568601424" data-id="1543568601424"></div></div><!--gfsplit--><div data-label="Row" id="r-1676976874176" class="gf_row" data-icon="gpicon-row" data-id="1676976874176" data-extraclass=""><div class="gf_column gf_col-lg-9 gf_col-md-9 gf_col-sm-9 gf_col-xs-12" id="c-1543568570869" data-id="1543568570869" style=""><div data-label="Text Block" id="e-1676976874222" class="element-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-textblock" data-ver="1" data-id="1676976874222"><div class="elm text-edit gf-elm-left gf-elm-left-md gf-elm-left-sm gf-elm-left-xs gf-elm-left-lg gf_gs-text-paragraph-1" data-gemlang="en" data-exc=""><p>L2 Gym risk assessment tutorial</p></div></div><div data-label="Text Block" data-key="text-block" id="e-1676976874183" class="element-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-textblock" data-ver="1" data-id="1676976874183"><div class="elm text-edit gf-elm-left gf_gs-text-paragraph-1" data-gemlang="en"><p>As a Gym Instructor you may be required to undertake risk assessments. This tutorial will help with the risk assessment task in your coursework.</p><p><br></p></div></div><div data-label="Vimeo" data-key="vimeo" data-atomgroup="module" id="m-1676976874204" class="module-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-vimeo" data-ver="1" data-id="1676976874204" style=""><div class="module " data-url="https://vimeo.com/800811840/5305bca857" data-autopause="1" data-autoplay="0" data-badge="" data-videoloop="0" data-byline="0" data-showtitle="0" data-showportrait="0" data-videomute="0"><div class="vimeo_video videoFullScreen"></div></div><div class="gf_vimeo-overlay"></div></div></div><div class="gf_column gf_col-lg-3 gf_col-md-3 gf_col-sm-3 gf_col-xs-12" id="c-1543568601424" data-id="1543568601424"></div></div><!--gfsplit--><div data-label="Row" id="r-1643396914180" class="gf_row" data-icon="gpicon-row" data-id="1643396914180" data-extraclass=""><div class="gf_column gf_col-lg-9 gf_col-md-9 gf_col-sm-9 gf_col-xs-12" id="c-1543568570869" data-id="1543568570869" style=""><div data-label="Text Block" id="e-1643396914123" class="element-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-textblock" data-ver="1" data-id="1643396914123"><div class="elm text-edit gf-elm-left gf-elm-left-md gf-elm-left-sm gf-elm-left-xs gf-elm-left-lg gf_gs-text-paragraph-1" data-gemlang="en" data-exc=""><p>L2 Gym maintenance checklist</p></div></div><div data-label="Text Block" data-key="text-block" id="e-1643396914263" class="element-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-textblock" data-ver="1" data-id="1643396914263"><div class="elm text-edit gf-elm-left gf_gs-text-paragraph-1" data-gemlang="en"><p>Some essential health & safety skills that a fitness trainer needs to understand when working in the fitness industry.</p><p><br></p></div></div><div data-label="Vimeo" data-key="vimeo" data-atomgroup="module" id="m-1643396930118" class="module-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-vimeo" data-ver="1" data-id="1643396930118" style=""><div class="module " data-url="https://vimeo.com/686264125/722df4baba" data-autopause="1" data-autoplay="0" data-badge="" data-videoloop="0" data-byline="0" data-showtitle="0" data-showportrait="0" data-videomute="0"><div class="vimeo_video videoFullScreen"></div></div><div class="gf_vimeo-overlay"></div></div></div><div class="gf_column gf_col-lg-3 g